WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:03.570 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Father, please hear
our prayer for the poor.

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:04.838
- [Man] Thank you, Father, yes.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.840
- We beseech you for
the disenfranchised,

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:10.710 align:start size:84% position:16%
the less fortunate,
and those that suffer.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:15.415
Show us your will so we can
continue to do your work.

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:16.883
- Yes, Father.

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:21.421 align:start size:97% position:3%
- [Godly Voice] I have come
to answer your prayers.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:26.026
Listen carefully
to my instructions.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.594
- Hallelujah!

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:30.330
(heavenly music)

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:34.667
- [Godly Voice] I want you
to sell everything you own

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:38.438
and immediately begin
service to the poor.

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:44.577
- Just want to clarify,

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:47.914
to everything?

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:49.716
- [Godly Voice] Yes,

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:53.520
rid yourself of all
earthly possessions.

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:02.362
- Oh (beep), this
house is haunted!

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:05.131
(group screaming)
- It's a ghost!

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:05.965
Move!

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:08.735
- Go, go, go, go!

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.003
It's insidious!

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:16.876 align:start size:88% position:13%
- [Godly Voice] Ah, I
see what they did there.

